<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Hughes seen up, Dell rises.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Hughes seen up, Dell rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Electronics Corp shares are expected to open higher Thursday after the company reportedly received a bid of $9 billion for its defense assets from Raytheon Co, traders said.</p>
<p>Today's Wall Street Journal reported that according to sources, Hughes also received a bid for the defense assets from Northrop Grumman that is $200 to $500 million above the Raytheon offer.</p>
<p>Hughes shares finished Wednesday NYSE trade at 61.</p>
<p>Elsewhere, Dell Computer rose to 58-1/4 from 56-3/8 after Prudential Securities raised it to buy from hold.</p>
